  "details": "I have always been frustrated with Akimbo being too strong because it reduces the range of options in the game.\n\nAkimbo should be given a penalty of some sort, basically for reload time.\n\nIt should require 3 to 5 times the reload time for both reloads, after a few seconds of making a move while reloading or after shooting.\n\nAlso, when reloading, if one is reloading, the other's reload time time should be multiplied to prevent them from reloading. (If both run out of ammo at the same time, the main hand has priority)\n\nAkimbo is indeed powerful, but it should have its own weaknesses.\n\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
